# Python dependencies of the MESA MCP servers, installed into /opt/vice/python
# (python-build-standalone 3.13) inside the tools image. Compiled with hashes by
# `make python-lock` (uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal) so the
# install runs in --require-hashes mode (ADR-0011). Source tarballs are the
# commits pinned in resources.yaml.
